> trolls could do that much damage in just a couple of whacks.

Once you have a way of generating monsters, a sacrifest cycle with
prayer and tuned luck is more efficient at giving AC points than using
gold.  Gold's effect drops once your naked AC is 0 and it can not take
you below -10 no matter how many times you try.  The sacrifest loop hits
its limit at -127 AC.  By then you have so many spellbooks and such you
likely exitted the loop anyways.

